Third-party notice: swaggo/swag
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

nexs-swag is an evolution of swaggo/swag (https://github.com/swaggo/swag) and
includes portions derived from it, in particular:

  - the Go comment annotation syntax and its parsing semantics
    (general API info, operation and struct-tag annotations);
  - the command-line interface (`init` and `fmt` commands and their flags);
  - the `.swaggo` type-overrides file format.

